msgid ""
"You have selected an action, but you haven’t saved your changes to individual fields yet. Please click "
"OK to save. You’ll need to re-run the action."
msgstr ""
"Amalni tanladingiz, lekin maydonlardagi o‘zgarishlar hali saqlanmagan. Saqlash uchun OK ni bosing, "
"so‘ng amalni qayta ishga tushiring."

msgid ""
"You have selected an action, and you haven’t made any changes on individual fields. You’re probably "
"looking for the Run button rather than the Save button."
msgstr ""
"Amalni tanladingiz va maydonlarda o‘zgarish yo‘q. Ehtimol, sizga «Saqlash» emas, «Bajarish» tugmasi "
"kerak."
